# Thin two-terminal wrappers over the committed atomic LCSC passives, each
# exposing p1/p2. Using the pre-picked atomic parts directly (rather than stdlib
# Resistor/Capacitor + lcsc_id) keeps the build hermetic: stdlib picks re-query
# the components API + EasyEDA on every build, whereas these carry a
# has_part_picked trait and need no network. See hardware/README.md.

